# clear-new-player.sk
# Skript (https://skriptlang.org) for Minecraft 1.21.4 / Paper-Spigot
# Requires: Skript 2.9+ (or latest release supporting 1.21.4) — vanilla Skript only, no addons.
#
# Guarantees a brand-new player starts with nothing: empties their main
# inventory, armor slots, and ender chest on their very first join.
# (Bukkit's inventory clear doesn't touch armor slots on its own, so
# that's cleared separately.)

on first join:
	clear player's inventory
	clear player's armor slots
	clear player's ender chest
